# STEP 1 — RAW MATERIAL PURCHASE

### 1. Korai purchase

Karur-la irundhu Korai வாங்குறீங்க.

System-la:

```text
Purchase ID
Supplier Name
Date
Vehicle Number
Korai Quantity
Unit
Rate
Transport Cost
Total Cost
Received By
Storage Location
```

### Example

```text
Purchase ID : KP-2026-001

Supplier     : ABC Korai Supplier
Date         : 12-08-2026
Vehicle      : TN-XX-1234

Quantity     : 100 Mukal
Conversion   : 1 Mukal = 4 Mudi

Total Mudi   : 400 Mudi

Korai Cost   : ₹40,000
Transport    : ₹5,000

Total        : ₹45,000
```

System automatically:

```text
100 Mukal × 4
       ↓
400 Mudi
       ↓
Raw Material Stock +400 Mudi
```

**Important:** Intha conversion system itself handle pannum. Manual calculation thevai illa.

