# 📊 PROFIT & LOSS — THIS IS THE BIGGEST BENEFIT

Every finished mat-ku actual production cost calculate panna mudiyum.

Suppose one mat:

```text
Raw Korai Cost       ₹80
Dye Cost             ₹10
Cleaning Labour       ₹8
Dye Labour            ₹7
Machine Labour       ₹15
Thread Cutting        ₹5
WFH Labour           ₹10
Transport             ₹5
Electricity           ₹5
--------------------------------
Total Cost          ₹145
```

Selling price:

```text
₹200
```

Profit:

```text
₹200 - ₹145
= ₹55 profit / mat
```

If 1,000 mats sold:

```text
₹55 × 1,000
= ₹55,000 profit
```

🔥 **Ithu automatic-a generate panna mudiyum.**

